少年よ 神話になれ
Young boy, become a legend!

469
00:54:01,934 --> 00:54:08,934
蒼い風がいま 胸のドアを叩いても
Even if a blue wind knocks on the door to your heart right now,

470
00:54:08,934 --> 00:54:15,734
私だけをただ見つめて 微笑んでるあなた
You just look at me and smile.

471
00:54:15,734 --> 00:54:22,434
そっと触れるもの 求めることに夢中で
Obsessed with seeking out something gently touching you,

472
00:54:22,434 --> 00:54:28,934
運命さえまだ知らない いたいけな瞳
With innocent eyes that don't even know fate yet.

473
00:54:28,934 --> 00:54:35,434
だけどいつか気付くでしょう その背中には
But someday you'll probably realize that on your back,

474
00:54:35,434 --> 00:54:42,234
遥か未来目指すための 羽根があること
You have wings to head for the far-off future.

475
00:54:46,934 --> 00:54:50,234
残酷な天使のテーゼ
A cruel angel's thesis

476
00:54:50,234 --> 00:54:53,434
窓辺からやがて飛び立つ
Will soon take flight through the window.

477
00:54:53,434 --> 00:54:56,934
ほとばしる熱いパトスで
With surging, hot pathos,

478
00:54:56,934 --> 00:55:01,434
思い出を裏切るなら
If you betray your memories...

479
00:55:01,357 --> 00:55:03,857
この宇宙を抱いて輝く
Shine, holding the sky in your arms,

480
00:55:03,857 --> 00:55:08,857
少年よ 神話になれ
young boy, become a legend!

481
00:55:54,157 --> 00:56:01,157
ずっと眠ってる 私の愛の揺りかご
The cradle of my love has slept for so long...

482
00:56:01,357 --> 00:56:08,857
あなただけが 夢の使者に 呼ばれる朝がくる
The morning will come when only you are summoned by a messenger of dreams.

483
00:56:09,157 --> 00:56:16,357
細い首筋を 月あかりが映してる
The moonlight shines upon your slender neck.

484
00:56:16,357 --> 00:56:23,557
世界中の時を止めて 閉じこめたいけど
I want to stop time across the world and lock you away, but...

485
00:56:23,557 --> 00:56:31,157
もしもふたり逢えたことに 意味があるなら
If there is a meaning to the two of us meeting,

486
00:56:31,157 --> 00:56:38,357
私はそう 自由を知る ためのバイブル
then I am, yes, the bible for learning freedom.

487
00:56:38,357 --> 00:56:46,157
残酷な天使のテーゼ 悲しみがそしてはじまる
A cruel angel's thesis, and then sorrow begins...

488
00:56:46,157 --> 00:56:53,557
抱きしめた命のかたち その夢に目覚めたとき
The moment you awaken to the dream of the form of life you embraced,

489
00:56:53,557 --> 00:57:01,157
誰よりも光を放つ 少年よ 神話になれ
shining brighter than anyone else, young boy, become a legend!

490
00:57:01,357 --> 00:57:08,857
人は愛をつむぎながら 歴史をつくる
People weave love together as they create history,

491
00:57:08,857 --> 00:57:16,157
女神なんてなれないまま 私は生きる
and while unable to become a goddess, I will live on.

492
00:57:16,157 --> 00:57:23,857
残酷な天使のテーゼ 窓辺からやがて飛び立つ
A cruel angel's thesis will eventually fly out from the window,

493
00:57:23,857 --> 00:57:31,357
ほとばしる熱いパトスで 思い出を裏切るなら
if you betray your memories with an overflowing, burning pathos.

494
00:57:31,357 --> 00:57:34,557
この宇宙を抱いて輝く
Shine, holding the sky in your arms,

495
00:57:34,557 --> 00:57:39,857
少年よ 神話になれ
young boy, become a legend!

496
